# ====== V22 FINAL CONCURRENCY / TIMING / MIRROR-RACE HARDENING ======
# This patch keeps every V21 behavior and memory key. It closes three remaining
# failure modes found under stress tests:
# 1) concurrent album images could race on the same badge/output temp file;
# 2) late function replacements could make duplicate timing appear "not run";
# 3) username variants could occupy the mirror worker pool before every mirror
